; Deck 3 - the Reactor Sumps.
;
; This is where the garrison went. The coolant sumps are lined with chitin
; and the brood is well established: Genestealers in the dark, Androids
; walking their old patrol routes through the middle of it, and a Dreadnought
; sealed in the plant room that has not decided whose side it is on.

Wandering-Monsters
(   1D12
    1-2     "2 Genestealers (50 Points)"
    3-3     "3 Chaos Androids (45 Points)"
    4-5     "1 Genestealer, 2 Chaos Androids (55 Points)"
    6-6     "3 Genestealers (75 Points)"
    7-7     "4 Chaos Androids (60 Points)"
    8-8     "2 Genestealers, 2 Chaos Androids (80 Points)"
    9-9     "2 Orks, 2 Genestealers (70 Points)"
   10-10    "4 Genestealers (100 Points)"
   11-11    "3 Genestealers, 2 Chaos Androids (105 Points)"
   12-12    "1 Dreadnought (50 Points)"
)

Lairs-Matrix
(   1D12
    1-1     "4 Genestealers (100 Points)"
    2-2     "6 Chaos Androids (90 Points)"
    3-3     "3 Genestealers, 3 Chaos Androids (120 Points)"
    4-4     "5 Genestealers (125 Points)"
    5-5     "4 Chaos Androids, 2 Genestealers (110 Points)"
    6-6     "2 Genestealers, 1 Dreadnought (100 Points)"
    7-7     "5 Genestealers, 2 Chaos Androids (155 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
    8-8     "6 Chaos Androids, 3 Genestealers (165 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
    9-9     "6 Genestealers (150 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
   10-10    "4 Genestealers, 1 Dreadnought (150 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
   11-11    "5 Genestealers, 4 Chaos Androids (185 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
   12-12    "8 Genestealers (200 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
)

