    3-3     "8 Genestealers (200 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
    4-4     "5 Genestealers, 1 Dreadnought (175 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
    5-5     "6 Genestealers, 4 Chaos Androids (210 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
    6-6     "8 Chaos Androids, 4 Genestealers (220 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
    7-7     "8 Genestealers, 4 Chaos Androids (260 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos-Double()
    8-8     "6 Genestealers, 1 Dreadnought, 4 Chaos Androids (270 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos-Double()
    9-9     "10 Genestealers (250 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos-Double()
